about looting and rioting in the evening, especially in Frankfurt, overshadowed the spirit of the demonstrations.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Merz hopes for Korean reunification at DMZ</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e3402b8d319ab24d008bbc6410c86be6a1a008e684fbbc7965621ae34cb5d675</id><updated>2026-11-01T15:18:56Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T14:46:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-merz-hopes-for-korean-reunification-at-dmz/live-79803462--f2cebaec800e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-merz-hopes-for-korean-reunification-at-dmz/live-79803462?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Chancellor Friedrich Merz has expressed hope for Korean reunification during a visit to the heavily fortified border. Meanwhile, President Steinmeier has held talks with China's Xi Jinping in Beijing.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany takes cautious approach on Israeli election results</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:dbb79ea56d16f6da20cae9ce9eaad49f4b9bb5a006689859361aa864b8b4aa1a</id><updated>2026-11-01T15:18:56Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T11:26:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-takes-cautious-approach-on-israeli-election-results/a-79805184--6eb977f23eb2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-takes-cautious-approach-on-israeli-election-results/a-79805184?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">German politicians have been slow to respond as they wait to see who is likely to comprise the next coalition. Many are also hoping for a government without religious hardliners.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>The dachshund, a humorous icon with political symbolism</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:fcad094f4a9f7f57f486e175adf4a7fddc27e16b2628019f32c6322923422652</id><updated>2026-11-01T15:18:56Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T07:57:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/the-dachshund-a-humorous-icon-with-political-symbolism/a-79640191--0ec0144d606e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/the-dachshund-a-humorous-icon-with-political-symbolism/a-79640191?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">From Picasso to Andy Warhol, a surprising number of artists have portrayed the German breed. But the dachshund has also at times been co-opted as a political symbol.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Germany seeks new head of state</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:58cd3ef5736ce8549653d2db45ccd8bd390764681cb68e6987d48e5c8301410c</id><updated>2026-11-01T15:18:56Z</updated><published>2026-10-29T14:27:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-seeks-new-head-of-state/a-79797794--10071c049ea1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-seeks-new-head-of-state/a-79797794?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The question of who should become Germany's new presiden is becoming pressing. Many want to see Germany's first female head of state. Chancellor Friedrich Merz is keeping his cards close to his chest.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Wagner brothers begin new NBA chapter on different paths</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c1c4a17104858ee9be801111eec1c5da027abd9daf4fc2dfb72f9d6edb16e75a</id><updated>2026-11-01T15:18:56Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T12:31:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/wagner-brothers-begin-new-nba-chapter-on-different-paths/a-79712668--ff5544415c4f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/wagner-brothers-begin-new-nba-chapter-on-different-paths/a-79712668?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After five years, brothers Franz and Moritz Wagner are no longer playing together for the Orlando Magic. In the new NBA season, their separation will likely mean the new "German" team is the Charlotte Hornets.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry></feed>
